  "new_behavior": [
    "The inline generation worker rejects empty input, invalid JSON, and non-chat request shapes before calling urlopen, so a child that observes stdin EOF cannot submit an empty POST.",
    "Termination is confirmed only when kill() was requested and wait()/poll() observed reaping. A process that exited without a kill request is not reported as sender_terminated; unconfirmed states remain pending.",
    "Popen spawn is represented as pending until a process handle is registered; timeout cancellation and spawn registration synchronize through a condition.",
    "A 50 ms reserve of the 60 second budget starts cancellation early enough to kill/reap before the hard request deadline; both epochs and the reserve are persisted.",
    "If cancellation returns while spawn is still pending, a later process is killed and reaped before communicate can write request bytes.",
    "A timeout records response_unknown, does not start HF, and the durable intent blocks retry. v3 F-schema, exact-byte bootstrap, shared run lock, and python -O safety checks are retained."
  ],
